<title>USA: Digex names John Welling CFO.</title>
<headline>Digex names John Welling CFO.</headline>
<dateline>BELTSVILLE, Md. 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Digex Inc said Thursday it had named John Welling, vice president and controller, to the additional post of chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Welling succeeds Thomas Brandt, who will be in charge of integrating acquisitions, the company said.</p>
<p>Digex also said it had named Clyde Heintzelman president of the company's Business Internet Connectivity Group, and Earl Galleher as president of the company's Web Presence Management Group.</p>
